<title>USA: New York Fed says H.3 data temporarily delayed.</title>
<headline>New York Fed says H.3 data temporarily delayed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of New York said data from the H.3 report, including figures on free reserves, were temporarily delayed.</p>
<p>Other figures indicated free reserves in the July 16 two-week period would total $910 million. However, these data could not immediately been confirmed, the Fed said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
